  "description": "REWNAK crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H138 Mn3 N2 Nd4 O33. From the CIF bond table, Mn1 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Nd1 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 6 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.634-3.952 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.69-107.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H138Mn3N2Nd4O33. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 12 Piv (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 tea (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Mn(II), Nd(III).",
